ig software providers where we pay  for the infrastructure in the data  infrastructure  i think recently we've seen a really big  shift in the approach  of how we approach building products  and tesco technology is really moving  towards a  kind of open cir open source first  approach  and i think especially in the data world  so i've been fortunate enough that at my  time at tesco  i've been able to see the growth of our  data platform  and it's really matured and it's  entirely built on top of open source  technologies  and it's allowed us to build great data  science products for the organization  while also kind of reducing the costs  that you know would be typically  associated with  using kind of paid for solutions from  external companies  [Music]  you

